1
00:00:00,834 --> 00:00:02,784
(Amy:)I know how you feel.

2
00:00:02,936 --> 00:00:06,216
(Amy:)Sheldon ignored me for a week
when he got that Roomba vacuum.

3
00:00:08,175 --> 00:00:10,315
(Amy:)I kick it when he's not looking.

4
00:00:12,546 --> 00:00:13,546
(Bernadette:)What are they doing?

5
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:16,327
(Howard:)They're drinking beer
and watching football.

6
00:00:16,483 --> 00:00:18,123
(Bernadette:)So why don't you do that
with them?

7
00:00:18,319 --> 00:00:20,629
(Howard:)-They don't want me.
-What do you mean?

8
00:00:22,289 --> 00:00:24,399
(Howard:)Well, Sheldon started talking
about how his dad isn't alive anymore,

9
00:00:24,558 --> 00:00:25,898
(Howard:)and they were toasting,
and I tried to tell them

10
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:27,736
(Howard:)about how sad I was
when my dad abandoned--

11
00:00:27,828 --> 00:00:29,068
(Amy:)Zack's here!

12
00:00:29,897 --> 00:00:31,877
(Raj:)Stir the gravy.

13
00:00:34,468 --> 00:00:36,468
(Bernadette:)Sorry. I really want
to hear how sad you are.

14
00:00:36,637 --> 00:00:38,637
(Bernadette:)I'll be back in, like, five, ten minutes.

15
00:00:43,343 --> 00:00:45,483
Sony she made you come
over here on a holiday.

16
00:00:45,646 --> 00:00:47,556
(Zack:)It's all right.
I didn't have anything going on.

17
00:00:47,715 --> 00:00:49,165
(Zack:)Plus, Penny told me we're married,

18
00:00:49,316 --> 00:00:51,856
(Zack:)and Thanksgiving's a time
to be with family.

19
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:53,860
(Penny:)Yeah, okay great.

20
00:00:53,987 --> 00:00:54,827
(Penny:)Can we just get this over with?

21
00:00:54,988 --> 00:00:58,198
Yeah, you guys
have to sign here and here.

22
00:00:58,359 --> 00:01:00,029
(Leonard:)On Monday,
we'll tile for the annulment,

